              <div class="doc-section-kicker">Per-Controller Setup &amp; 6-Phase Cut Cycle Guides</div>
              <h3 class="doc-section-heading">Open Your Controller Guide</h3>
              <p class="doc-section-desc">
                Each page shows the 6-phase torch motion timeline alongside the exact G-codes, M-codes, and registers emitted in every stage.
              </p>
